# VidyaBot – Offline AI Teacher using Gemma 4

VidyaBot is an offline educational AI assistant built using Google Gemma 4 models for rural and low-connectivity learning environments.

## Features
- Educational Q&A
- Lightweight AI
- Rural accessibility
- Offline-first concept

## Tech Stack
- Gemma 4
- Transformers
- Gradio
- Google Colab
